ce through the full version in the future 💌 🎁 And in case you missed it, we're currently giving away exclusive The Serena Villa Files merchandise for free! Head over to our socials to find out how you can win one for yourself 👀 Thank you for all your love and","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-23T06:20:55Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114035155","verified_at":"2026-10-23T09:07:22Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4893850-1846651706693914","game_id":"steam-4893850","kind":"update","title":"Our Demo Reached No. 1! Thank You & Update Notes 🧡","summary":"Hello, this is the The Serena Villa Files dev team! 🔎Thanks to your incredible love and support,The Serena Villa Files demo has reached No. 1! 🎉We're truly grateful for the amazing response we've received, and we'll keep working hard to make the game even better!We've also been carefully reading through all your reviews and feedback since the demo launched.In particular, we understand that the loading issues have caused frustration for many players, and we've already released a patch with some i","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-20T06:34:47Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706693914","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:26:55Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4893850-1846651706689469","game_id":"steam-4893850","kind":"announcement","title":"DEMO Out Now on Steam","summary":"Global story game developer STORYTACO has released a Steam demo for its upcoming FMV romance thriller, The Serena Villa Files.Steam Link: The game marks the Korean FMV debut of Chinese actress Wang Han, who gained widespread popularity for her portrayal of Wen Lan (Serena Wen) in the hit Chinese FMV game Knowledge, or know Lady. It is also STORYTACO's first project featuring a Chinese actress, bringing together popular Korean and Chinese performers and influencers in a new cross-border K-FMV pro","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T09:40:04Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706689469","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:26:55Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4893850-1846651706688996","game_id":"steam-4893850","kind":"announcement","title":"🎬 Storytaco FMV Live Stream","summary":"🎬 Celebrate the launch of The Serena Villa Files Demo!Join us for a special live stream celebrating the release of The Serena Villa Files Demo!Get a first look at the game, meet its captivating characters, and experience a thrilling story filled with romance, mystery, and unexpected twists.🎮 Discover the world of The Serena Villa Files 💕 Meet the characters and explore their stories 🔥 Experience the demo and get a sneak peek at what's to come!The demo is now available to play for free!Don't forg","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T06:40:50Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706688996","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:26:55Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4893850-1844751498230838","game_id":"steam-4893850","kind":"announcement","title":"Official PV Now Available! 🔎","summary":"Hello, this is Storytaco!The official PV for our new FMV romance thriller,The Serena Villa Files, is now available! 🎬Jihyuk becomes the only male security guard at a women-only residence,only to discover suspicious traces on the CCTV from his very first day...Just when it seems like an ordinary romance,unexpected incidents and a growing mystery begin to unfold.Experience a different side of Storytaco FMV,where romance, suspense, and hidden twists come together in the official PV.▶ \\▶ \\Please loo","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-28T08:12:42Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844751498230838","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:26:55Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4893850-1842846814454558","game_id":"steam-4893850","kind":"announcement","title":"STORYTACO Unveils Q4 FMV Roadmap Featuring New Global Collaborations","summary":"Global story-driven game developer STORYTACO has unveiled its FMV (full-motion video) roadmap for the last quarter of 2026. From September through the end of the year, the company plans to expand its FMV lineup through platform expansions for existing titles, new game launches, demo releases, and new Steam store pages. According to the roadmap, STORYTACO will begin expanding its platforms in September with the mobile release of two existing FMV titles. In October, the company will launch a new t","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-08T03:21:17Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842846814454558","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:26:55Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4893850-1842846814452218","game_id":"steam-4893850","kind":"announcement","title":"BeautyGirls Story ES is on TikTok!","summary":"Hello from the Storytaco FMV Team! 💗We are excited to announce that our official Spanish TikTok account is now open! 🌮✨From now on, Spanish-speaking fans can enjoy Storytaco FMV news, clips, character content, and more in Spanish.Follow us here: BeautyGirls Story ES on TikTokCome say ¡hola!, leave us a comment, and let’s interact more there! 💬✨Thank you always for your love and support 💕For more updates on Storytaco FMVs:▶ Instagram▶ Discord▶ Twitter","occurred_at":nul